            "review_text": "Kristof v\nBrussels, Belgium11 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Indonesian food.\nJul 2026 • Family\nWe found this place by walking in the old quarter.\nWe want to try this restaurant because we like Indonesian food but didn’t have big expectations to eat real Indonesian food in Hanoi.\n\nThis restaurant surprised us, here you can eat the authentic Indonesian kitchen. All flavors were matching. The same taste as you can find in Bali or Indonesia.\nWhat a nice place to eat and so many choices on the menu.\n\nThe cook and staff was so friendly.\nI can recommend this place when you like Indonesian food.\nWill go back to this restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 21, 2026",
